Package: python3-pympacds-http
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 python3-pympacds (>= 0.2.0),
 python3-aiohttp
Description: HTTP client service for pympacds
 pympacds-http sends data over HTTP on behalf of other services and exposes
 it over D-Bus, with automatic retry and optional mutual TLS.
 .
 It uses a single pooled aiohttp session and exposes the HTTP contract
 (send/download/request with the request_completed signal) alongside the
 framework Health and Config contracts.
